    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This contract outlines the terms and conditions for the website migration project between Grist & Toll (Client) and Acme Corp (Contractor)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**1. WORK AND PAYMENT**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**1.1 Project Description**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The Client is hiring the Contractor to design, develop, deploy, and support a new e-commerce website for Grist & Toll, migrating from the existing WordPress/WooCommerce platform to Webflow. The primary goal is to address current operational inefficiencies and enhance the customer user experience, thereby increasing sales and improving overall brand perception."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Core Challenges Being Addressed:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-12",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Operational inefficiencies preventing creation of critical educational content"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-13",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Excessive time consumption from manual order management and inventory updates"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-14",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Administrative burden from WooCommerce backend complexities"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-15",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Need for streamlined platform automation to free up strategic time"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The project is divided into three core phases:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Phase 1: WordPress Backend Optimization (2 weeks - June 23 - July 7)**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-19",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Initial Consult (Completed by June 23)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-20",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Backend Cleanup (June 23 - June 30): Remove redundant plugins, unused themes, database cleanup"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-21",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "UX Improvements (June 23 - June 30): Checkout flow, shipping information, mobile responsiveness"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-22",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "WooCommerce Updates (June 30 - July 7): Core updates, essential add-ons, conflict resolution"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-23",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Security Audit (July 7): Site security review, plugin configuration, vulnerability scans, backup verification"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-24",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Review (July 7): Present completed work, gather feedback, confirm readiness for migration"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Phase 2: Webflow E-commerce Migration & Essential Redesign (12 weeks - July 7 - September 1)**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-35",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-27",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Template Selection & Design System Creation (July 7 - July 14)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-28",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Asset Migration & Optimization (July 14 - July 21): Images, videos, media"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-29",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Product Migration & CMS Structure Development (July 21 - July 28)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-30",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Stripe Integration & Payment Flows Configuration (July 28 - August 4)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-31",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Content Population & SEO Setup (August 4 - August 11): Meta tags, structured data, sitemaps"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-32",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "QA & Testing (August 11 - August 18)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-33",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Launch Preparation (August 18 - August 25): Domain setup, 301 redirects, monitoring tools"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-34",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Deployment & Post-Launch Monitoring (August 25 - September 1)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-36",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Phase 3: Optional Maintenance & Ongoing Support (Ongoing, via retainer)**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-43",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-37",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Performance Monitoring"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-38",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Content Updates"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-39",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Visual Enhancements"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-40",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Feature Integration"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-41",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "SEO Optimization"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-42",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Analytics & Reporting"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-44",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**1.2 Schedule**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-45",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The Contractor will begin work on June 23, 2025, with an anticipated launch for the core e-commerce site on September 1, 2025. The work is ongoing for the duration of the retainer outlined in Section 1.3, if applicable. This Contract can be ended by either Client or Contractor at any time, pursuant to the terms of Section 6, Term and Termination."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-46",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**1.3 Payment Structure**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-47",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Web Essentials Development (One-time payment):**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-52",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-48",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Standard rate: $1,680 USD total"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-49",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "With FRAM25 discount (25% off): $1,260 USD total"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-50",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Payment is due at project start"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-51",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Important:** If the FRAM25 discount is not applied at the time of payment, the difference will not be refunded"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-53",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Optional Ongoing Support & Maintenance Retainer (Creative Suite Plan):**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-62",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-54",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Standard rate: $900 USD per month"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-55",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "With FRAM25 discount (25% off): $675 USD per month"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-56",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Plan details and management: https://payment.turtle.tech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-57",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Client may terminate anytime through payment portal after initial deposit"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-58",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "No refunds for partial monthly periods"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-59",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Client retains access to services through the end of the paid period"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-60",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The FRAM25 discount remains valid as long as service is not interrupted"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-61",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "If the FRAM25 discount is not applied at time of payment, the difference ($225 USD per month) will not be refunded"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-63",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Creative Suite Retainer Includes:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
