        {
          "id": "b-86",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Content updates"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-87",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Technical troubleshooting"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-88",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "SEO monitoring"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-90",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "If a service request is outside the same scope of work as the deliverable, the work will begin after a separate proposal document is drafted by the Contractor and approved by the Client. The Contractor reserves the right to determine if a support request requires a separate Statement of Work based on scope, complexity, and resource requirements."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-91",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**2. OWNERSHIP AND LICENSES**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-92",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**2.1 Client Owns All Work Product**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-93",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "As part of this job, the Contractor is creating a \"work product\" for the Client. \"Work product\" includes:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-103",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-94",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
