          "id": "b-100",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Product data and CMS structure"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-101",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Payment gateway configurations"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-102",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Migration assets and optimization"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-104",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The Contractor hereby gives the Client this work product once the Client pays for it in full. This means the Contractor is giving the Client all rights, titles, and interests in and to the work product (including intellectual property rights), and the Client will be the sole owner of it."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-105",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**2.2 Contractor's Use Of Work Product**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-106",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Once the Contractor gives the work product to the Client, the Contractor may only:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-110",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-107",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Use screenshots or recordings of the public-facing website in their portfolio"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-108",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Reference the project in their client list and marketing materials"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-109",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Share non-confidential technical details about the implementation"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-111",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The Contractor may not:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-115",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-112",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Reuse custom design elements created specifically for the Client"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-113",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Share or reuse any of the Client's product data, brand assets, or related content"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-114",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Disclose any non-public information about the Client's business or projects"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-116",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**2.3 Contractor's Help Securing Ownership**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-117",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "In the future, the Client may need the Contractor's help to show that the Client owns the work product or to complete the transfer. The Contractor agrees to help with that. If the Client can't find the Contractor after spending reasonable effort trying to do so, the Contractor hereby irrevocably designates and appoints the Client as the Contractor's agent and attorney-in-fact to execute required documents and take legal action to accomplish the purposes of paragraph 2.1."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-118",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**2.4 Contractor's IP That Is Not Work Product**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-119",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "During this project, the Contractor might use:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-126",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-120",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Webflow development platform"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-121",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Analytics tools and scripts"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-122",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "SEO optimization tools"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-123",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Social media management tools"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-124",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Standard web development frameworks and libraries"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-125",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Design tools and software"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-127",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This \"background IP\" remains the property of the Contractor or its respective owners. The Client receives a perpetual, non-exclusive license to use these tools as part of the delivered website."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-128",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**2.5 Contractor's Right To Use Client IP**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-129",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The Client grants the Contractor limited rights to use:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-134",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-130",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The Client's name and business title"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-131",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Public product data, brand assets, and content"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-132",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Publicly available photos and media"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-133",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Business information and credentials"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-135",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This use is strictly limited to implementing the website and related marketing materials."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-136",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**3. COMPETITIVE ENGAGEMENTS**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-137",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The Contractor will not work for a direct competitor of Grist & Toll during the term of this contract and for 6 months after completion, specifically in the specialty flour milling and heritage grain industry."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-138",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**4. NON-SOLICITATION**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-139",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "During the term of this contract and for 12 months after, neither party will solicit the other party's employees or contractors."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-140",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**5. REPRESENTATIONS**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-141",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**5.1 Authority To Sign**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-142",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Each party promises to the other party that it has the authority to enter into this Contract and to perform all of its obligations under this Contract."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-143",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**5.2 Contractor Has Right To Give Client Work Product**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-144",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The Contractor promises that they own the work product, that the Contractor is able to give the work product to the Client, and that no other party will claim that they own the work product."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-145",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**5.3 Contractor Will Comply With Laws**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-146",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The Contractor promises that the manner they do this job, its work product, and any background IP it uses comply with applicable U.S. and foreign laws and regulations."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-147",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**5.4 Work Product Does Not Infringe**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-148",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The Contractor promises that their work product does not and will not infringe on someone else's intellectual property rights."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-149",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**5.5 Client Will Review Work**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-150",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The Client promises to review the work product, to be reasonably available to the Contractor if the Contractor has questions regarding this project, and to provide timely feedback and decisions."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-151",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**5.6 Client-Supplied Material Does Not Infringe**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-152",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "If the Client provides the Contractor with material to incorporate into the work product, the Client agrees to:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-157",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-153",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Ensure any original content provided does not infringe on third-party intellectual property rights"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-154",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Follow fair use guidelines and proper attribution protocols when incorporating copyrighted content"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-155",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Obtain necessary licenses or permissions for any copyrighted material where fair use does not apply"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-156",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Work with the Contractor to implement appropriate captioning and citation practices for third-party content"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-158",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**6. TERM AND TERMINATION**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-159",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This Contract begins on June 17, 2025, and continues until terminated by either party."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-160",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Initial Development Phase (June 23 - September 1, 2025)**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-163",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-161",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Client may terminate with 7 days written notice"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-162",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "If terminated before launch:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-164",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- All work completed to date must be paid in full"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-165",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Any remaining balance of the $1,260 payment is non-refundable"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-166",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Client must pay all outstanding balances before work product can be delivered"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-168",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-167",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Upon site launch (September 1st):"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-169",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Final delivery of all features outlined in the SOW"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-170",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- After launch, Client has the option to engage Contractor's support services under a separate retainer agreement"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-171",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Optional Monthly Maintenance Retainer (Creative Suite Plan)**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-178",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-172",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Standard rate: $900 USD per month (or $675 with FRAM25 discount)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-173",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Plan details and management: https://payment.turtle.tech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-174",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Either party may terminate with 30 days written notice"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-175",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "No refunds for partial months"
