    },
    {
      "id": "b-179",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**In all cases:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-183",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-180",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Notice must be delivered via email as specified in section 11.4"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-181",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Contractor must immediately stop work upon receiving notice"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-182",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Final invoice for any outstanding work will be issued upon termination"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-184",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**7. INDEPENDENT CONTRACTOR**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-185",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The Client is hiring the Contractor as an independent contractor. The Contractor will use their own equipment, tools, and material to do the work. The Client will not control how the job is performed on a day-to-day basis. The Contractor is responsible for their own taxes and is not entitled to the Client's benefits."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-186",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**8. CONFIDENTIAL INFORMATION**"
        }
      ]
    },
