      "id": "b-187",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**8.1 Overview**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-188",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Both parties understand the importance of protecting:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-194",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-189",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Unreleased product information and business strategies"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-190",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Client relationships and contacts"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-191",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Technical workflows and methodologies"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-192",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Business strategies and pricing"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-193",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Analytics and performance data"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-195",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**8.2 The Client's Confidential Information**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-196",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The Contractor agrees to protect:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-203",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-197",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Proprietary milling processes and grain sourcing information"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-198",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Customer data and order information"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-199",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Business strategies and future plans"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-200",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Technical preferences and workflows"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-201",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Website analytics and performance data"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-202",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Any other information marked as confidential"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-204",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**8.3 Third-Party Confidential Information**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-205",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Each party promises that they will not share confidential information that belongs to third parties, unless they are allowed to do so."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-206",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**9. LIMITATION OF LIABILITY**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-207",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Neither party is liable for breach-of-contract damages that the breaching party could not reasonably have foreseen when it entered this Contract."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-208",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**10. INDEMNITY**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-209",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**10.1 Client Indemnity**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-210",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The Contractor agrees to indemnify the Client from and against all liabilities, losses, damages, and expenses (including reasonable attorneys' fees) related to a third-party claim arising out of:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-214",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-211",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The work the Contractor has done under this Contract"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-212",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A breach by the Contractor of its obligations under this Contract"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-213",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A breach by the Contractor of the promises in Section 5"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-215",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**10.2 Contractor Indemnity**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-216",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The Client agrees to indemnify the Contractor from and against liabilities, losses, damages, and expenses (including reasonable attorneys' fees) related to a third-party claim arising out of a breach by the Client of its obligations under this Contract."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-217",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**11. GENERAL**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-218",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**11.1 Assignment**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-219",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The Contractor cannot assign their rights or delegate their obligations under this Contract to a third-party without first receiving the Client's written permission. The Client may assign their rights and delegate its obligations under this Contract without the Contractor's permission."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-220",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**11.2 Arbitration**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-221",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Any dispute arising under this Contract may be resolved by arbitration administered by the American Arbitration Association in accordance with its commercial arbitration rules. Any arbitration proceedings shall be conducted in Missouri, unless both parties agree in writing to a different location."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-222",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**11.3 Modification; Waiver**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-223",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "To change anything in this Contract, both parties must agree to that change in writing and sign a document showing their agreement."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-224",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**11.4 Notices**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-225",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Notices must be in writing and delivered via:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-227",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-226",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Email to:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-228",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Client: [nan@gristandtoll.com](mailto:nan@gristandtoll.com)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-229",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Contractor: [user@example.com](mailto:user@example.com)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-232",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-230",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Physical mail to addresses provided separately"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-231",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Personal delivery to authorized representatives"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-233",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**11.5 Severability**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-234",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "If a portion of the Contract is found to be unenforceable, the unenforceable portion will be changed to the minimum extent necessary to make it enforceable. If any portion is disregarded, the rest of the Contract remains enforceable."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-235",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**11.6 Signatures**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-236",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Both parties can use electronic signatures, which count as originals for all purposes."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-237",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**11.7 Governing Law**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-238",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The laws of the state of Missouri govern the rights and obligations under this Contract."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-239",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**11.8 Entire Contract**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-240",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This Contract represents the parties' final and complete understanding of this job and supersedes all other contracts between the parties."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-241",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**11.9 Force Majeure**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-242",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Neither party will be liable for delays or failures in performance resulting from causes beyond their reasonable control, including but not limited to acts of God, war, strikes, pandemics, supply chain disruptions, or significant vendor/platform outages."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-243",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**11.10 Client Portal & Third-Party Tools**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-244",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The Contractor uses various third-party tools to facilitate project management and communication. Service management and billing is handled through https://payment.turtle.tech. The Contractor is not liable for temporary outages, data loss, or service interruptions caused by third-party platforms."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-245",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**11.11 Retainer Onboarding Process**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-246",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Clients wishing to transition to the Creative Suite retainer after website launch shall:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-252",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-247",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Notify the Contractor via email of intent to begin retainer services"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-248",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Receive a Stripe payment link for the monthly subscription"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-249",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Complete a brief onboarding questionnaire to align on priorities"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-250",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Gain access to the client portal within 24 hours of first payment"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-251",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Schedule an optional 1-hour kickoff call to discuss strategy"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-253",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The FRAM25 discount remains valid if activated within 30 days of website launch."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-254",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**11.12 Retainer Service Activation & Management**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-255",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The Contractor provides structured retainer services to ensure continued success after website launch (anticipated on September 1, 2025). Full service details and current offerings are available at https://payment.turtle.tech."
        }
      ]
    },
